flowchart LR
    FILE[Immutable file bytes] --> SPLICE[Splice escaped newlines]
    SPLICE --> TOKENS[Preprocessing tokens and physical ranges]
    TOKENS --> DIRECTIVES[Per-file conditional state]
    DIRECTIVES --> INCLUDE[Canonical include identities]
    INCLUDE --> TOKENS
    DIRECTIVES --> MACROS[Per-TU macro table]
    MACROS --> ARGS[Raw arguments and argument prescan]
    ARGS --> REPLACE[Substitution, stringification, placemarkers, pasting]
    REPLACE --> HIDE[Hide sets and replacement rescanning]
    HIDE --> SPANS[Rendered text with spelling and expansion spans]
    SPANS --> LEX[Semantic tokens mapped to original sources]
    LEX --> DIAG[Invocation diagnostic and definition note]
